                <!-- ── Category 1: Orders & Delivery ── -->
                <div class="faq-category reveal" id="orders">
                    <div class="faq-category-header">
                        <div class="faq-cat-icon"><i class="fas fa-truck"></i></div>
                        <h2>Orders &amp; Delivery</h2>
                        <span>8 Questions</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-list">

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">How long does delivery take after I place my order?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>Delivery timelines vary based on your location and the product ordered. For
                                        in-stock items, we typically deliver within <strong>7–14 business days</strong>
                                        across all major cities.</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Bangalore: 5–7 business days</li>
                                        <li>Tier 2 cities (Jaipur, Pune, Hyderabad, etc.): 8–12 business days</li>
                                        <li>Other cities: 12–18 business days</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p>Custom or made-to-order pieces may take an additional 3–5 weeks depending on the
                                        complexity of the design. You'll receive a detailed timeline confirmation once
                                        your order is placed.</p>
                                    <div class="answer-highlight"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> You'll receive SMS
                                        and email updates at every stage — order confirmed, in production, dispatched
                                        and out for delivery.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Do you offer free delivery? What is the minimum order
                                    value?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>Yes! We offer <strong>free doorstep delivery</strong> on all orders above
                                        ₹10,000. This covers all major cities and towns across India. For orders below
                                        ₹10,000, a nominal delivery fee of ₹499–₹999 is applied depending on your
                                        location.</p>
                                    <div class="answer-highlight"><i class="fas fa-truck"></i> Free delivery is
                                        applicable on 25+ cities across India — from Delhi to Kochi, Jaipur to Kolkata.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Do you offer assembly after delivery? Is it free?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>Absolutely. Our trained professional assembly team provides <strong>free in-home
                                            assembly</strong> on all Bedroom Sets (beds, wardrobes, dressers) and Dining
                                        Sets. Assembly is typically done on the day of delivery or the following day.
                                    </p>
                                    <p>For other products like sofas, coffee tables and accent chairs, assembly
                                        instructions are provided and most pieces are straightforward to assemble
                                        independently. However, if you prefer professional assembly, we can arrange it
                                        for a nominal fee of ₹299–₹799 per item.</p>
                                    <div class="answer-highlight"><i class="fas fa-tools"></i> Our assembly team handles
                                        everything — unpacking, assembly, placement and debris removal.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Can I track my order in real time?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>Yes. Once your order is dispatched, you will receive a <strong>tracking link via
                                            SMS and email</strong> that allows you to monitor your delivery in real
                                        time. You can also log in to your LuxeCasa account and check the order status
                                        under "My Orders".</p>
                                    <p>You'll receive automated notifications at each milestone: Order Confirmed → In
                                        Production → Quality Checked → Dispatched → Out for Delivery → Delivered.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Do you deliver to all cities in India?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>We currently deliver to <strong>25+ cities</strong> across India including Delhi
                                        NCR, Mumbai, Bangalore, Chennai, Hyderabad, Pune, Kolkata, Jaipur, Ahmedabad,
                                        Surat, Lucknow, Chandigarh, Indore, Kochi and more.</p>
                                    <p>If your city is not listed, please contact us via phone or WhatsApp — we often
                                        facilitate custom delivery arrangements for areas outside our standard zones at
                                        a quoted freight charge.</p>
                                    <div class="answer-highlight"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> Enter your PIN
                                        code at checkout to check delivery availability for your exact location.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Can I change or cancel my order after placing it?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>You can <strong>modify or cancel your order within 24 hours</strong> of placing
                                        it by calling us at +91 98765 43210 or emailing info@luxecasa.com. After 24
                                        hours, if production has begun (especially for custom orders), cancellations may
                                        attract a partial charge.</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Order cancelled within 24 hours: 100% refund</li>
                                        <li>Order cancelled within 48 hours (standard items): 90% refund</li>
                                        <li>Custom order cancelled after production begins: Up to 40% cancellation
                                            charge</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">What happens if my furniture is damaged during delivery?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>All LuxeCasa furniture is triple-wrapped and insured during transit. However, if
                                        you notice any damage upon delivery, here's what to do:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Do not sign the delivery receipt — note the damage clearly on it</li>
                                        <li>Take clear photographs of the damage immediately</li>
                                        <li>Contact us within 48 hours at +91 98765 43210 or WhatsApp us</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p>We will arrange a free replacement, repair or full refund — whichever you prefer
                                        — at no cost to you.</p>
                                    <div class="answer-highlight"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Every order is fully
                                        insured. You are 100% protected against transit damage.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Can I schedule a specific delivery date and time?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>Yes. Once your order is ready for dispatch, our delivery team will contact you
                                        24–48 hours in advance to confirm a <strong>preferred delivery date and 3-hour
                                            time window</strong> that suits you. We offer morning (9 AM–12 PM),
                                        afternoon (12 PM–4 PM) and evening (4 PM–8 PM) slots.</p>
                                    <p>If you need to reschedule, simply inform us at least 12 hours before the
                                        scheduled delivery and we will accommodate your new preference without any
                                        charge.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div><!-- /orders -->

                <!-- ── Category 2: Products & Materials ── -->
                <div class="faq-category reveal" id="products">
                    <div class="faq-category-header">
                        <div class="faq-cat-icon"><i class="fas fa-gem"></i></div>
                        <h2>Products &amp; Materials</h2>
                        <span>7 Questions</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-list">

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">What materials does LuxeCasa use for its furniture?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>We use only the finest, most durable materials in every piece we craft:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li><strong>Wood:</strong> Solid sheesham (Indian rosewood), teak, mango wood
                                            and FSC-certified engineered wood</li>
                                        <li><strong>Upholstery:</strong> Genuine leather, premium velvet, high-density
                                            foam (40D+)</li>
                                        <li><strong>Stone:</strong> Calacatta marble, white carrara, granite for
                                            tabletops</li>
                                        <li><strong>Metal accents:</strong> Brushed brass, matte black powder-coated
                                            steel</li>
                                        <li><strong>Fabrics:</strong> Belgian linen, jacquard weaves, performance
                                            fabrics</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <div class="answer-highlight"><i class="fas fa-leaf"></i> All our wood is sourced
                                        from FSC-certified suppliers — ethically harvested with zero-deforestation
                                        practices.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Are your products solid wood or engineered wood?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>It depends on the product range. Our <strong>Heritage and Artisan
                                            Collections</strong> are crafted from 100% solid sheesham or teak — making
                                        them heirloom-quality pieces that last generations.</p>
                                    <p>Our <strong>Contemporary and Urban Collections</strong> use premium engineered
                                        wood (E0-grade MDF/HDF) with solid wood veneers and solid wood structural
                                        frames. These are equally durable, more resistant to humidity, and offered at a
                                        more accessible price point. Each product page clearly states the wood type
                                        used.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Can I see and feel the fabric/material before buying?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>Absolutely. We offer two options:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li><strong>Showroom visit:</strong> Visit our flagship showroom in Connaught
                                            Place, New Delhi to see, touch and experience all our collections in person.
                                        </li>
                                        <li><strong>Fabric swatch samples:</strong> Request up to 5 free fabric/material
                                            swatches delivered to your doorstep within 3–5 days. Call us or use the
                                            Contact page to request your swatches.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p>We believe a purchase as significant as luxury furniture deserves a sensory
                                        experience — and we make it easy for you to get one.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Are the colours on the website exactly what I'll
                                    receive?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>We photograph all our furniture under controlled studio lighting and aim for
                                        maximum colour accuracy. However, minor variations may occur due to:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Individual screen calibration and colour temperature differences</li>
                                        <li>Natural grain and tone variations inherent in solid wood</li>
                                        <li>Slight batch-to-batch variations in fabric dye lots</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p>For colour-sensitive decisions, we strongly recommend ordering a fabric swatch or
                                        visiting our showroom before placing a large order.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                                <span class="faq-q-icon"><i class="fas fa-question"></i></span>
                                <span class="faq-q-text">Is LuxeCasa furniture suitable for Indian climate
                                    conditions?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>Yes — all our furniture is specifically designed and treated for India's diverse
                                        climate. Our solid wood pieces are kiln-dried to optimal moisture content
                                        (8–12%) before crafting, which significantly reduces warping and cracking in
                                        humid conditions.</p>
                                    <p>Our engineered wood pieces use moisture-resistant E0-grade boards that are
                                        especially suitable for kitchens, coastal areas and high-humidity regions. We
                                        also use water-resistant finishes and rust-proof hardware throughout.</p>
                                    <div class="answer-highlight"><i class="fas fa-sun"></i> LuxeCasa furniture is
                                        climate-tested for India — from the dry heat of Rajasthan to the coastal
                                        humidity of Kerala.</div>
                                </div>
