                                    furniture?</span>
                                <span class="faq-chevron"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="faq-answer">
                                <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                                    <p>For <strong>genuine leather</strong> sofas and chairs:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Wipe with a soft, clean cloth slightly dampened with distilled water</li>
                                        <li>Apply leather conditioner every 3–6 months to prevent drying and cracking
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Avoid direct sunlight which fades and dries leather</li>
                                        <li>Keep away from sharp objects to prevent scratches</li>
